      <bpmn2:dataOutputAssociation><bpmn2:sourceRef>Task_CheckDuplicate_ResultOutputX</bpmn2:sourceRef><bpmn2:targetRef>checkout</bpmn2:targetRef></bpmn2:dataOutputAssociation>
